lette with ocean-themed images and icons throughout the app.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Icon-based Condition Inputs",\n      "description": "Uses icons for selecting surf conditions like wind, tide, and mood for a more visual and engaging experience.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Sample Data Visualization",\n      "description": "Includes sample data for initial visualization and testing of stats dashboard and session history.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    }\n  ],\n  "techStack": {\n    "frontend": [\n      "Angular"\n    ],\n    "backend": [\n      "None"\n    ],\n    "language": [\n      "JavaScript (ES6+)"\n    ]\n  },\n  "colors": {\n    "primary": "#3A8DDE",\n    "secondary": "#F5E9D0",\n    "accent": "#20B2AA"\n  },\n  "theme": "auto",\n  "layoutDescription": "The home screen features a prominent \'+ Log New Session\' button at the top, followed by a scrollable list of past sessions as cards. Each card displays key session info and mood. The log session screen uses a form layout with icon-based pickers and sliders for conditions. Session detail view presents all data in a visually rich card, with edit/delete options. The stats dashboard uses simple, colorful charts. Oceanic backgrounds, icons, and color accents are used throughout for a cohesive, beach-inspired look."\n}'}",
